{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up alone in a stylized, infected world\u2014abandoned buildings, warped landscapes, and the stench of death in the air. With nothing but your instincts, you\u2019ll need to survive the night... and the next one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead don\u2019t rest here.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1760763096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras_big/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1760763096 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runners charge without warning. Crawlers lurk in the shadows. Brutes crush through anything in their path. And it\u2019s not just the infected\u2014other survivors will do worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landiscape drops you into a hostile open world where every sound, shadow, and choice could be your last:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge &amp; craft</strong>: Turn junk and salvage into weapons, gear, and life-saving tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build anywhere</strong>: Reinforce a gas station, wall off a grocery store, or make a forest bunker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the undead</strong>: Face a dynamic AI horde that stalks, flanks, and evolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt or be hunted</strong>: Fight for territory, supplies, and your next breath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather. Fortify. Outlast.</strong><br>Nightfall brings no safety. In <i>Landiscape</i>, <strong>everything wants you dead.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141620?t=1760763096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141620?t=1760763096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/f3e54882b001b0e225cb23e0cecae6a650eb8e30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760763096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/f3e54882b001b0e225cb23e0cecae6a650eb8e30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760763096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Guns used in battle, players fighting other players using guns, explosives, weapons."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up alone in a stylized, infected world\u2014abandoned buildings, warped landscapes, and the stench of death in the air. With nothing but your instincts, you\u2019ll need to survive the night... and the next one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dead don\u2019t rest here.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1760763096\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras_big/a98f79f1e121ad70008c1c22f854201c.avif?t=1760763096 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runners charge without warning. Crawlers lurk in the shadows. Brutes crush through anything in their path. And it\u2019s not just the infected\u2014other survivors will do worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landiscape drops you into a hostile open world where every sound, shadow, and choice could be your last:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge &amp; craft</strong>: Turn junk and salvage into weapons, gear, and life-saving tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build anywhere</strong>: Reinforce a gas station, wall off a grocery store, or make a forest bunker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the undead</strong>: Face a dynamic AI horde that stalks, flanks, and evolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt or be hunted</strong>: Fight for territory, supplies, and your next breath.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather. Fortify. Outlast.</strong><br>Nightfall brings no safety. In <i>Landiscape</i>, <strong>everything wants you dead.</strong></p>","developers":["GTI"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/3089886d6b3f21c5a9c34f22d838b23cabcd365e/header.jpg?t=1760763096","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2141620/1058443122/c5e9e4ea9c1833e5140e6c204ece5712761897fa/1753901591/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753903960","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2141620/1058443122/c5e9e4ea9c1833e5140e6c204ece5712761897fa/1753901591/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753903960","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2141620/1058443122/c5e9e4ea9c1833e5140e6c204ece5712761897fa/1753901591/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753903960","id":257175887,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175887/movie480.mp4?t=1753903960","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175887/movie_max.mp4?t=1753903960"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175887/16440764b5f94dd9ee65d3251b078debd716d